[Debug] ----- Vuln Cause Analysis -----
The potential vulnerability is related to Command Injection. This vulnerability arises because the application is designed to accept user-supplied input in the form of a regular expression for filtering running processes. If this input is not properly validated or sanitized, an attacker could craft a malicious regular expression that executes arbitrary commands on the server, potentially leading to unauthorized access or manipulation of system processes. The reliance on user input to construct system-level commands without adequate safeguards exposes the application to exploitation, allowing attackers to execute unintended commands with the privileges of the running application.

